# test: third_party_client
# description: A proto-generated client discovers profile sockets and lists their isolated agents

## Environment

config:
  name: local
  profiles: [personal, work]

directory:
  name: project

terminal:
  name: Personal
  cwd: project

terminal:
  name: Work
  cwd: project

terminal:
  name: Client

## Test

@Personal
> amux --profile personal new test-agent --name personal-agent
> ready
ready
echo: ready

@Work
> amux --profile work new test-agent --name work-agent
> ready
ready
echo: ready

@Client
> e2e-runner client list-profiles $local.front_door
Profiles:
  $local.personal.id  personal    $local.personal.socket_path
  $local.work.id  work    $local.work.socket_path

> e2e-runner client list-agents $local.front_door personal
Agents for personal:
  personal-agent  $project.path

> e2e-runner client list-agents $local.front_door work
Agents for work:
  work-agent  $project.path
